<h3>10.2 Quality evidence and reader comments</h3>
<p>The numerical readback, source-edition binding, self-contained presentation and
rebuild equality are checked automatically. Embedded machine evidence is rounded to
13 significant digits and compared numerically at relative tolerance 1e-12;
the remaining HTML is compared exactly. Monetary values and scores are displayed to
two decimal places; counts and years use integers; differences and ratios use one decimal.
These are presentation and regression conventions, not engineering acceptance limits.
Independent engineering validation remains
NOT_EVALUATED. The schematic is conceptual and carries no inferred design dimensions.</p>
